== Trivia ==
*If a player jumped into the areas with the [[Auction Agent|Auction Agents]] or the [[Auction Master]], the '''Goons''' would still tell them to get a {{Item|Happy Mask}}, even if they had one.
**This is possibly due to these two actions using the same pushing away mechanism.
*When clicked, '''Goons''' made a sound of a Slime jumping. It used to be a Villager mumbling with a tweaked pitch.<!--Did this change at some point? If so, when?-->
**Their Slime sounds were most likely a reference to how {{NPCSprite|Dante}} and the '''Goons''' transformed into Slimes during the [[The Uprising|boss fight]] against Dante.
* '''Goons''' were also near various locations like the [[Golden Dante Statue]], {{Zone|Fisherman's Hut}}, and most shops, but would let the player pass without a {{Item|Happy Mask}} or a {{Item|Dante's Talisman}}.

